    distanceLabel: 'Approximately 4 river miles round trip', paddleTime: '2–4 hours depending on discharge, stage, current, wind, shallow sections, breaks, and turnaround distance', summary: 'A bounded lower Millstone River same-access planning outing from the primitive Lincoln Avenue Park boat launch in Manville.', statusText: 'Planning route only. NJDEP identifies the Lincoln Avenue Park primitive boat launch and says drifting the Millstone by kayak, canoe, or small boat is the best approach; confirm the current launch, local waterline, debris, and lower-river conditions before travel.', gaugeSiteId: '01402000', gaugeSiteName: 'Millstone River at Blackwells Mills, NJ', thresholdSource: { label: 'NJDEP Millstone River boating and primitive-launch guidance', url: millstoneAccessUrl, provider: 'local' }, routeType: 'recreational', difficulty: 'moderate', riskLevel: 'caution', hazards: ['low_water', 'fast_rise', 'cold_water', 'strainers', 'urban_water_quality', 'access_uncertain'], safetyNotes: ['Wear a properly fitted PFD continuously, carry communication and rescue gear, and do not paddle beyond the group’s moving-water skills.', 'The lower Millstone can be shallow and debris-sensitive. The launch is below the former Weston Mill Dam area; current, bridge hydraulics, wood, and recent-rain conditions still require day-of scouting.', 'Do not use private banks, bridge shoulders, active infrastructure, or the Raritan confluence as an improvised bailout or take-out. Return to Lincoln Avenue Park before daylight, weather, or skill margins deteriorate.'], shuttle: 'No shuttle. Launch and return at Lincoln Avenue Park only after confirming current park access, parking, carry, waterline, and same-day turnaround conditions; do not stage on nearby private or utility property.', permits: 'Follow current Manville/Somerset County park rules, New Jersey boating and PFD requirements, any NJDEP/Somerset access notices, and current water-quality or storm advisories. The official primitive-launch reference does not guarantee current hours, maintenance, or paddlecraft loading conditions.', camping: 'No on-route camping is claimed. Use separately reserved lodging or a designated nearby campground; a public park launch does not grant shoreline camping rights.', campingClassification: 'nearby_basecamp', accessCaveats: ['NJDEP identifies a primitive boat launch at the southern end of Lincoln Avenue Park, but the reference is an access description rather than a current ramp survey; confirm current public status, parking, carry, waterline, and construction/closure notices.', 'The official NJDEP water-quality coordinate is labeled “Millstone River at park access of Lincoln Ave” and is an on/near-water access anchor, not a guarantee of a usable wetted-edge landing.', 'This is a same-access route. Do not substitute private shoreline, bridge shoulders, former dam structures, or the Raritan confluence for the named return.'], watchFor: ['USGS 01402000 Blackwells Mills discharge and stage as clearly labeled upstream proxy context, plus local depth and visual conditions', 'low water, fast rise after rain, strainers, shallow sandbars, bridge/current changes, cold water, and urban water quality', 'current park/launch status, parking, carry, daylight, weather, and hard Lincoln Avenue Park return'], evidenceNotes: [{ label: 'Named moving-water corridor', value: 'Lower Millstone River in Manville', note: 'NJDEP describes the Millstone as suitable for drifting by kayak, canoe, or small boat and identifies the lower-river primitive launch context.', sourceUrl: millstoneAccessUrl }, { label: 'Public water-entry evidence', value: 'Lincoln Avenue Park primitive boat launch', note: 'NJDEP identifies the launch at the southern end of Lincoln Avenue Park; the associated NJDEP monitoring record is explicitly named “Millstone River at park access of Lincoln Ave.”', sourceUrl: millstoneCoordinateUrl }, { label: 'Proxy flow evidence', value: 'USGS 01402000 Millstone River at Blackwells Mills', note: 'Use current discharge and stage as clearly labeled upstream proxy context only; no numeric recreational cutoff is inferred.', sourceUrl: 'https://waterdata.usgs.gov/monitoring-location/USGS-01402000/' }, { label: 'Camping posture', value: 'Nearby basecamp only', note: 'No informal shoreline camping entitlement is implied by the park launch.', sourceUrl: 'https://www.manvillenj.org/336/Borough-Parks' }], sourceLinks: [{ label: 'NJDEP Millstone River boating and launch guidance', url: millstoneAccessUrl, provider: 'local' }, { label: 'NJDEP water-quality access coordinate', url: millstoneCoordinateUrl, provider: 'local' }, { label: 'Manville Borough parks', url: 'https://www.manvillenj.org/336/Borough-Parks', provider: 'local' }, { label: 'USGS Millstone River at Blackwells Mills', url: 'https://waterdata.usgs.gov/monitoring-location/USGS-01402000/', provider: 'usgs' }], contextImageUrl: millstoneImage, contextImageNote: 'Official NJDEP same-river image of the removed Millstone dam area; it provides river context and does not certify current launch, flow, debris, or water-quality conditions.',
