    distanceLabel: 'Approximately 7 river miles', paddleTime: '4–8 hours depending on level, shallow water, obstacles, portages, and current park conditions', summary: 'A lower Batsto River planning section from Lower Forge toward Batsto Village using the NJDEP Batsto/Mullica water-trail map and campground/access landmarks.', statusText: 'Planning route only. NJDEP currently advises that the Batsto River is closed from Hampton Furnace to Lower Forge because of obstructions; this record begins at Lower Forge and still requires same-day confirmation that the lower section is open.', gaugeSiteId: '01409400', gaugeSiteName: 'Mullica River near Batsto, NJ', thresholdSource: { label: 'NJDEP Batsto and Mullica River Water Trails guide', url: batstoMullicaUrl, provider: 'local' }, routeType: 'recreational', difficulty: 'hard', riskLevel: 'advanced', hazards: ['low_water', 'fast_rise', 'cold_water', 'strainers', 'dam', 'mandatory_takeout', 'access_uncertain'], safetyNotes: [...commonSafety, 'Do not enter the Hampton Furnace-to-Lower Forge closure. The current Wharton advisory controls even if an older map shows the reach.', 'Batsto-area mill, impoundment, bridges, and portage hazards require scouting; do not run an unmarked obstruction or dam.'], shuttle: 'Use a vehicle shuttle only after Wharton confirms both named access areas and the route is open. Stage at Batsto Village, launch at Lower Forge, and maintain a hard portage/take-out plan.', permits: 'Follow Wharton State Forest hours, vehicle/road/parking restrictions, current Batsto closure alerts, New Jersey boating/PFD law, and the Batsto/Mullica canoe/kayak guidance.', camping: 'Lower Forge and other named Wharton campgrounds are reservation/permit-controlled. No camping is implied outside designated sites.', campingClassification: 'endpoint_campground', accessCaveats: ['Current Wharton closure information overrides the older water-trail map; verify the lower reach is open before departure.', 'Batsto Village and Lower Forge coordinates are near-water access anchors, not guarantees of a usable ramp or obstruction-free take-out.', 'Do not portage onto private land or use a closed area as an emergency route.'], watchFor: ['current Wharton Batsto closure/obstruction advisory', 'USGS 01409400 proxy trend versus actual level, recent rain, low water, strainers, and cold water', 'Batsto mill/impoundment hazards, designated camp status, road access, and daylight'], evidenceNotes: [{ label: 'Named moving-water corridor', value: 'NJDEP Batsto/Mullica water-trail map; Lower Forge to Batsto Village planning section', note: 'The official map names access, campground, portage, and hazard context. This record deliberately excludes the currently closed Hampton Furnace-to-Lower Forge segment.', sourceUrl: batstoMullicaUrl }, { label: 'Current closure control', value: 'Wharton State Forest advises paddlers not to use Hampton Furnace to Lower Forge due to obstructions', note: 'The alert is a hard safety gate and is not silently ignored by this route package.', sourceUrl: whartonUrl }, { label: 'Proxy flow evidence', value: 'USGS 01409400 Mullica River near Batsto, clearly labeled watershed proxy', note: 'No numeric Batsto route threshold is inferred.', sourceUrl: 'https://waterdata.usgs.gov/monitoring-location/USGS-01409400/' }, { label: 'Camping posture', value: 'Designated Wharton endpoint campground subject to reservation/closure', note: 'No informal shoreline camping is claimed.', sourceUrl: batstoMullicaUrl }], sourceLinks: [{ label: 'NJDEP Batsto and Mullica water trails', url: batstoMullicaUrl, provider: 'local' }, { label: 'NJDEP Wharton State Forest current advisory', url: whartonUrl, provider: 'local' }, { label: 'USGS Mullica River near Batsto', url: 'https://waterdata.usgs.gov/monitoring-location/USGS-01409400/', provider: 'usgs' }], contextImageUrl: pineBarrensImage, contextImageNote: 'Mullica River in the Pinelands; approved same-water-family context and not evidence that the Batsto section is currently open.',
